    "markdown": "# ![](https://app.gusto.com/companies/288da0ce-6702-4901-8cba-2b0574bea75c/logo?v=1756138745)    Hostimus LLCDigital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)  Remote  ·   Full time      [Apply for Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)](https://jobs.gusto.com/postings/hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9/applicants/new)\n\nDigital Marketing Account Manager\n\n### About Hostimus LLC\n\nAt Hostimus, we value our employees and consider them a part of our family. We are committed to providing a supportive and flexible work environment. We look forward to you joining our team and contributing to our shared success.\n\n### Description\n\nWe are excited to announce an opportunity for a remote digital marketing account manager to join our vibrant and supportive team. This role is perfect for those who thrive in a positive and flexible work environment that encourages collaboration.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n- Foster strong relationships with high-value client accounts, ensuring their needs are met and expectations are exceeded.\n- Regularly connect with clients to discuss account status and future plans, promoting open communication and partnership.\n- Stay at the forefront of the digital marketing industry trends and practices, fostering a culture of learning and innovation.\n\nQualifications:\n\n- Demonstrated experience in project management.\n- Comprehensive knowledge of the digital marketing industry and practices.\n- Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills, promoting a positive and collaborative team culture.\n- Ability to manage multiple accounts and deadlines simultaneously, demonstrating flexibility and adaptability.\n\nCompensation:\n\n- Our account managers receive a competitive compensation of 15% of the total accounts they manage, reflecting our commitment to rewarding hard work and success.\n\nThis role offers the flexibility of remote work, allowing you to achieve a healthy work-life balance. We believe in creating an environment where everyone can thrive, and we look forward to welcoming you to our team.\n\n#### Salary\n\n$120,000 - $160,000 per year\n\n[Apply for Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)](https://jobs.gusto.com/postings/hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9/applicants/new)",
