ital Marketing Account Manager (Remote) at Hostimus LLC\">\n<meta name=\"og:description\" value=\"Digital Marketing Account Manager\">\n<meta name=\"og:url\" value=\"https://jobs.gusto.com/postings/hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" value=\"Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote) at Hostimus LLC\">\n\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" value=\"Digital Marketing Account Manager\">\n\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" value=\"https://app.gusto.com/companies/288da0ce-6702-4901-8cba-2b0574bea75c/logo?v=1756138745\">\n  <meta name=\"og:image\" value=\"https://app.gusto.com/companies/288da0ce-6702-4901-8cba-2b0574bea75c/logo?v=1756138745\">\n\n\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.cookielaw.org/scripttemplates/202608.1.0/otBannerSdk.js\" async=\"\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script></head>\n\n  <body class=\"bg-gray-100\" data-action=\"job_postings-show\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto lg:px-8 lg:py-12 px-6 py-6\">\n      \n\n<div class=\"relative py-16 bg-white overflow-hidden rounded-sm\" data-controller=\"referrer\" data-slug=\"hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9\">\n  <div class=\"relative px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"text-lg max-w-prose mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"mb-12\">\n        \n  <nav class=\"sm:hidden\" aria-label=\"Back\">\n    <a class=\"flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700\" href=\"https://jobs.gusto.com/boards/hostimus-llc-eb66ca5f-70bb-4f7e-8cf9-7db07624e0c5\">\n      <!-- Heroicon name: chevron-left -->\n      <svg class=\"flex-shrink-0 -ml-1 mr-1 h-5 w-5 text-gray-400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414L9.414 10l3.293 3.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414l4-4a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg>\n      Back\n</a>  </nav>\n<nav class=\"hidden sm:flex\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"\">\n              <a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700\" href=\"https://jobs.gusto.com/boards/hostimus-llc-eb66ca5f-70bb-4f7e-8cf9-7db07624e0c5\">Careers at Hostimus LLC</a>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <svg class=\"flex-shrink-0 h-5 w-5 text-gray-400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.293 14.707a1 1 0 010-1.414L10.586 10 7.293 6.707a1 1 0 011.414-1.414l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 ml-4\">Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n      </div>\n      <h1>\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <div class=\"mb-8\" alt=\"company-logo\"><img class=\"inline max-h-40\" style=\"max-width: min(280px, 100%);\" src=\"https://app.gusto.com/companies/288da0ce-6702-4901-8cba-2b0574bea75c/logo?v=1756138745\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"block text-base text-center text-indigo-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase\">Hostimus LLC</span>\n        <span class=\"mt-2 block text-3xl text-center leading-8 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl\">Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)</span>\n        <span class=\"mt-2 block text-base text-center text-gray-900\">\n              Remote\n              ·\n\n            Full time\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"block text-center\">\n          <div class=\"inline-flex rounded-md shadow md:mt-8\">\n              <a class=\"flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-md text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700\" href=\"https://jobs.gusto.com/postings/hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9/applicants/new\">Apply for Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </h1>\n      <div class=\"mt-8 text-xl text-gray-800 leading-8\">\n        <p>Digital Marketing Account Manager</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-8 text-xl text-gray-600 leading-8\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl leading-8 font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-700\">About Hostimus LLC</h3>\n        <div data-controller=\"rich-text\">\n         <div class=\"rich-text-container\" data-rich-text-target=\"richTextContainer\">\n            <p>At Hostimus, we value our employees and consider them a part of our family. We are committed to providing a supportive and flexible work environment. We look forward to you joining our team and contributing to our shared success.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-8 text-xl text-gray-600 leading-8\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl leading-8 font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-700\">Description</h3>\n        <div data-controller=\"rich-text\">\n          <div class=\"rich-text-container\" data-rich-text-target=\"richTextContainer\">\n            <p>We are excited to announce an opportunity for a remote digital marketing account manager to join our vibrant and supportive team. This role is perfect for those who thrive in a positive and flexible work environment that encourages collaboration.</p><p><br></p><p>Responsibilities:</p><ul><li>Foster strong relationships with high-value client accounts, ensuring their needs are met and expectations are exceeded.</li><li>Regularly connect with clients to discuss account status and future plans, promoting open communication and partnership.</li><li>Stay at the forefront of the digital marketing industry trends and practices, fostering a culture of learning and innovation.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Qualifications:</p><ul><li>Demonstrated experience in project management.</li><li>Comprehensive knowledge of the digital marketing industry and practices.</li><li>Exceptional communication and interpersonal skills, promoting a positive and collaborative team culture.</li><li>Ability to manage multiple accounts and deadlines simultaneously, demonstrating flexibility and adaptability.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Compensation:</p><ul><li>Our account managers receive a competitive compensation of 15% of the total accounts they manage, reflecting our commitment to rewarding hard work and success.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>This role offers the flexibility of remote work, allowing you to achieve a healthy work-life balance. We believe in creating an environment where everyone can thrive, and we look forward to welcoming you to our team.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-8 text-xl text-gray-600 leading-8\">\n        <h4 class=\"mb-4 text-3xl leading-8 font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-700\">Salary</h4>\n        <p class=\"mt-4\">$120,000 - $160,000 per year</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"block text-center\">\n        <div class=\"inline-flex rounded-md shadow md:mt-8\">\n            <a class=\"flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-md text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700\" href=\"https://jobs.gusto.com/postings/hostimus-llc-digital-marketing-account-manager-remote-057d7f22-bbe3-4a78-9fd7-5254aa9771a9/applicants/new\">Apply for Digital Marketing Account Manager (Remote)</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\" id=\"footer\">\n        <a class=\"optanon-toggle-display cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center\">\n\tYour Privacy Choices\n\t<s